            </div>
            <div class="text-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-emerald-100">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl">🆓</div>
